---
description: Decide field-level findings for applyChannels.
args: { goal: string; slice: EvidenceSlice }
returns: DecisionAtom[]
---
Apply this domain algorithm to the prepared slice: Generate channel-specific assets that serve actual user tasks while respecting length, format, and factual constraints. Adapt emphasis and tone to context, preserve required disclosures, and avoid treating a slogan as a substitute for useful product information. For each consequential field return a value and evidence IDs, mark established, disputed, unknown, or inapplicable, and name a plausible alternative. Do not turn missing evidence into a negative fact or treat repeated volume as independent support unless the domain rule says so.
